# Hard locks

- Never write Relovi or Littleloop in product copy, UI, emails, or PDFs.
- Public copy is all-trades. Never electrician-only. Never BTS-only. Public product name is Grafter.
- Do not add modules. Deepen jobs, quotes, invoices, schedule, JHA, inspections, Take 5, and clients.
- LOOK is laptop 1280 and phone against quote paper in `docs/look/`. A CSS diff is not proof.
- Route product work through poteto-mode. Prove it works on the real path before done.
